never before had the private exchange of  british royals and their senior palace  staff been so exposed  texts and emails by meghan markle and  prince harry to their former press aide  have been published as part of mail on  sunday's case against the duchess at the  court of appeal they revealed fractures  among the royal family as meghan's  relationship with her father broke down  and pressure increased on harry to  contain thomas marco's communication  with the press  in one text to jason nauf megan writes  even after a week with his dad and  endlessly explaining the situation his  family seemed to forget the context she  continues by taking this form of action  i protect my husband from the constant  berating emails are supposed to be a  letters of pride private letters between  people but once you're in the public  domain in a court of law then it can  become excruciatingly embarrassing for  for those people that don't particularly  want these things aired i don't think  it's that particularly damaging or  problematic for the for prince charles  who was simply saying can't something be  done to stop this  constant story of megan and her father  appearing in the press emails to jason  canav also reveal the extent to which he  acted as a conduit to pass background  information from the couple to the  authors of their biography finding  freedom with megan sending a long list  of topics she wanted covered from  relationships with her half-siblings to  press stories she felt needed correcting  in one email the press secretary warned  against connecting megan's friends to  authors of finding freedom he wrote  being able to say hand on heart that we  did not facilitate access will be  important and in response prince harry  said i totally agree that we have to be  able to say that we didn't have anything  to do with it  megan has this week apologized to the  court for denying that mr knauf had  provided information to the authors  saying she had not remembered those  exchanges at the time  even though he said in a witness  statement they discussed the book on a  routine basis multiple times in person  and over email  judges will decide on this case at a  later date but it's in the court of  public opinion where this battle is also  being fought  milano vaseline rich sky news
 

